        ],
        "title": "Decompose into $$P(x)$$ and $$Q(x)$$.",
        "text": "To express $$\\log_2\\left(\\frac{(x+1)**5}{(x-2)**2}\\right)$$ in the form $$\\log_2\\left(\\dfrac{P(x)}{Q(x)}\\right)$$ , we have $$P(x)=\\left(x+1\\right)^5$$",
